sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Application
    participant O as Outbox
    participant M as Gestão
    A->>O: enqueue(event, idempotencyKey)
    O-->>A: persisted receipt
    O->>M: flush pending
    alt gestão disponível
        M-->>O: ack
        O->>O: mark delivered
    else indisponível
        M-->>O: transient failure
        O->>O: keep pending + backoff
    end
